WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
The Pattern layout works like FL Studio. This is the Channel rack: each row is a sound.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Click the steps to make a beat. A kick on every beat...

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.600
...a clap on two and four, and hi-hats in between.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.200
Press Play: the pattern loops.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.400
The Piano roll is for melodies. F7 opens it.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:32.600
Click in the grid to draw notes. Each row is a key.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.400
The Playlist, F5, builds the song.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.000
Click on a track to place the pattern.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.800
Switch to Song mode and press Play to hear the Playlist.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:50.800
The Mixer, F9, sets the levels and holds the effects of every channel.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.200
That's a beat, made the FL Studio way.
